This repository is a public reference proof that exercises the Simply360
Integration Marketplace event destination, remote automation actions, and
signed inbound remote triggers against Slack. It uses only public Simply360
platform boundaries (published SDK, OAuth, webhooks, manifests, Blueprint
packages, and extension protocols). It contains no Simply360 internal database
models, worker imports, provider secrets, or authorization logic.

